    <div class="StandardBoxHeader" style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span>What Parents (and kids) are Saying</span></div>
    <div id="ParentsContainer" class="StandardBox">
        <a name="top"></a>
        <a id="ctl00_cphRoblox_PageImage" class="PageImage" onclick="__doPostBack('ctl00$cphRoblox$PageImage','')" style="display:inline-block;cursor:pointer;"><img src="/images/Parents/WhatParentsAreSaying.png" border="0" onerror="return Roblox.Controls.Image.OnError(this)" blankurl="/ext/t6bg.roblox.com/blank-256x256.gif"/></a>
        <div class="DescriptionText">
            <p>
                We are always collecting testimonials from our users and their parents. Please send
                your comments to <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20101122224810/mailto:info@roblox.com">info@roblox.com</a>.
            </p>
            <ul style="list-style: none;">
                <li><a href="#Parents">Parent testimonials</a></li>
                <li><a href="#Kids">Kid testimonials</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="ParentsLearningContent">
            <div class="StandardBoxLightHeader">
                <a name="Parents">Parents</a></div>
            <blockquote>
                <p>
                    <strong>Micheal</strong><br/>
                    My son is obsessed, it's all he talks about, and he's already designing his "own"
                    roblox style game.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Lelaine</strong><br/>
                    This game is very good for my children. I have three children playing roblox and
                    they got each other to join. It is helping my oldest with a "what i want to be when
                    i grow up" subject he is doing at school. He wants to be a programmer and program
                    games so this site is helping him by teaching him skills. Also I love this site
                    because it lets my kids be creative. Also its helping teach my kids laws of physics
                    and lots of other stuff. Finaly a game my kids have fun on without blood and gore!!!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Karen</strong><br/>
                    My boys, ages 10 and 8 just created an account to explore your games. I think the
                    "safety blocks" you automatically established are a God-send. I don't know much
                    about this gaming stuff, but I did read your policies, procedures and commend you
                    for making the blocks "automatic". Thanks. Be vigilant. As a parent, I try to understand
                    but I don't. I need companies, gamers to help protect the children.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Sam</strong><br/>
                    I have to say I really appreciate your product as my son asked me to order him a
                    Lua book, and now he is starting to get really involved with scripting, advertising
                    and 'day trading' all because of Roblox. Now, I am busy hearing my son talk non-stop
                    about ads, clicks and currency trading on Roblox - gotta love it.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Melody</strong><br/>
                    My son absolutly adores your site and he's grown up so much on it. He had been diagnosed
                    with aspurgers syndrome at a very young age, and I feel that ROBLOX has greatly
                    helped him with his social skills as well as his focus in school, dispite this.
                    I hope that ROBLOX can continue to grow into something truly great!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Jeffrey</strong><br/>
                    "Hi, I just wanted to tell you how much I appreciate Roblox. My son who is 12 uses
                    your service all the time. One of the movie competitions motivates him to sit down
                    and learn new software to develop new movie scenes. I watched him a couple days
                    ago, working hard on powerpoint, windows movie maker and other software, trying
                    to make his Roblox movie. He didn't know how to use any of this software and learned
                    it on his own through his motivation from Roblox. It's kind of neat how simple things
                    like having a special 'hat' for his character is so gratifying to him. He joined
                    the Roblox Builders Club a few days ago. He was willing to give up $5 a month from
                    his allowance per month to pay for it (we are paying for it, but appreciated his
                    devotion). Anyway, I appreciate your service and also how safe it is for kids. I
                    am enjoying seeing him thrive from the competition and creativity you challenge
                    your users with. Best of luck with Roblox."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Sam &#151; CA</strong><br/>
                    "My 11 year old son has been involved with Roblox for 9 months now. Since he began
                    he has learned much about scripting, and other computer related tasks....Your website
                    has helped him with his self-esteem and social development as well. The whole time
                    he has been thoroughly entertained by Roblox. His dream is to someday make video
                    games, and i am certain that the time he spends participating in the Roblox community
                    will help him achieve that goal."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Dan &#151; FL</strong><br/>
                    "I am a parent of two boys (11 and 12) who absolutely love ROBLOX. As a Software
                    Engineer myself, I am interested in getting my boys more involved in engineering
                    in general, ROBLOX has been a big help."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Scott</strong><br/>
                    "My son loves your site even more than the Wii he got for Xmas. Further, he has
                    turned on at least 4 of his friends who are now members and he gave up his membership
                    in Club Penguin to join your site. We have to pry him away from the puter on a daily
                    basis. Not sure whether to thank you or not........lol"
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Stacy</strong><br/>
                    "I think [we] will join! This online game is fantastic. I was hoping my son’s gaming
                    would lead to programming, and he is now learning Object Oriented scripting. Fantastic!!
                    And he’s 11. This game grows with the child, that is for sure."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Susan &#151; CA</strong><br/>
                    "My son only wants two things for Christmas, and one is a membership to Builders
                    Club. He's hoping Santa will bring it!"
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Koh and Cecile &#151; Phillipines</strong><br/>
                    "Yosh started writing a novel more than a year ago. Now in Grade 4, he is fascinated
                    with the Internet; [We think] he is the first Filipino to join the Roblox role-playing
                    gaming site."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>GM</strong><br/>
                    "I think most kids who use ROBLOX are creative and bright. My child loves your site.
                    If my child wasn't such a good student I would lock the site, but because we have
                    an exceptional student, this is the reward!!!! Truly just loves it!!"
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Penny &#151; United Kingdom</strong><br/>
                    "Having paid out for quite a few destruction/build/animate games in the past which
                    my Grandson has played for maybe a few days then tired of, it is amazing that ROBLOX
                    seems for months now to have met his needs. His mom is now getting him Builders
                    Club!"
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Rick &#151; South Carolina</strong><br/>
                    "My son loves ROBLOX."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Tracy &#151; San Francisco</strong><br/>
                    "Our PC died, so our son has been off of ROBLOX for a couple of weeks &#151; and
                    clearly was not happy about it. Finally he was able to log on and was quite gleeful
                    in trying out all the new ROBLOX adventures..."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Paulette</strong><br/>
                    "My son has been playing on Roblox for over a month and really does enjoy the site."
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Menno, Netherlands</strong><br/>
                    "Today my son (Jelle) will have his speech at school about Roblox. He is addicted
                    to Roblox, I can't tell you why. I think it's pretty amazing among all those shooting
                    games or fast speed etc. Your game is more positive and stimulating than the most
                    games on the internet, keep on going!"
                </p>
            </blockquote>
            <div class="StandardBoxLightHeader">
                <a name="Kids">Kids</a></div>
            <blockquote>
                <p>
                    <strong>Max X.</strong> Hello! I just wanted to tell you that without Roblox, I
                    probably never would have gotten into scripting. A couple of years ago, I got into
                    TI-Basic (a programing language for TI calculators featuring the bestest and most
                    awesome capabilities that a calculator could muster), and I made a random assortment
                    of games and homework accelerating programs, but I never got into using any language
                    on a computer. Roblox, on the other hand serves as a perfect transition for me.
                    It's a bit boring for me to sit in front of a large manual, attempting to create
                    programs on a computer, but Roblox is something different. I know, it's a bit weird
                    for a high school senior to be playing a game designed for... shall we say, a more
                    youthful audience... but I have always loved to build with [INSERT POPULAR BRAND
                    OF BLOCKS], and a digital version piqued my interest. I had heard of Lua before,
                    and simply building with virtual bricks was not enough to satisfy me. Roblox isn't
                    just another workspace for scripts or code, it's a full game to boot! Very simple
                    scripts could have immediate and significant results in-game. From my first "game.Workspace.Bogden.Head:Remove()"
                    I was hooked. My interest evolved, and within a few weeks, I had utilized the forums
                    and the Wiki to learn Roblox Lua. Without Roblox, I wouldn't have transitioned from
                    the calculator to the computer. Though it's a late start, I may just end up in a
                    programming field while in college. Thank you, Max X. aka Bogden
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Damian</strong> I have been on roblox for over a month and it is one of
                    the best online games ever thats online. Before I found roblox I was the most boring
                    kid I know during that summer the next day I told one of my friends about it then
                    he got an account. PS: If I had to rate robox I would give it a 1,000,000,000/1,000,000,000
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Jason</strong> You know, ROBLOX is a great game designed to keep kids safe,
                    and have fun at the same time. It's a great way to learn computer engineering while
                    chatting with thousands of other players. I really think ROBLOX is a great game.
                    Way to go guys!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>PivokHate</strong> I Love To Build And I Cant Quit!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Matt</strong> This is probably the coolest game ever!!! One because of all
                    the amazing things you can do on it!! And two cause it's sooo much fun!!!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Mark</strong> I've only been coding for about 10 months actualy, Roblox
                    is what got me into programming. I realy must take this opprotunity to thank roblox
                    for getting me into programming, Which I spend most of my time doing. If it weren't
                    for roblox introducing me to programming I'd still be wasting precious hours of
                    my youth playing Runescape =P.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Ghiop0</strong> Roblox is a fun, energetic site that allows kids to chat
                    with friends, play games, such as build to survive or obstacle courses. Being a
                    member for only 4 months, I have developed friendships with over 20 friends, earned
                    many badges such as the Warrior badge, and played a TON of fun and creative obstacle
                    courses, rescue missions, etc. I am hoping to continue my life on roblox as a Bloxxer.
                    ;)
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Brandon</strong> If i never found this i would be a bored kid. Roblox is
                    a very creative game and i like creative games! I have an Xbox 360 and i hardly
                    play it! Most the time im on here! Whenever i get home from school i always finish
                    my homework fast to play on roblox, whenever its a weekend i start playin right
                    when i get up!!!! If i were to rate this from 1 to 10 as 10 being Totally Awsome!
                    I would rate it over 10, like 20!!!! Sincerely- One of your biggest fans!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Anonymous</strong><br/>
                    I can safely say that this is the best online game I have ever played. People are
                    always on,and are (Mostly) always friendly. I got several of my friends hooked,
                    and they all love it. One of my friends, Ollie, I told him about it, he created
                    an account and now, he's a famous member (Jangofettt, if you wanna know). Anyway,
                    apart from the occasional evil TKers and SKers, this is an amazing game. Long story
                    short, GO ROBLOX!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Dylan</strong><br/>
                    I just wanted to let you know your site rocks! You see me and my friend used to
                    play club penguin, that was untill we found out about ROBLOX. It all started when
                    we went to summer camp, and this kid named Conan told us about ROBLOX. Then, when
                    we got back at home, we downloaded it and loved it! So We Told Austin, (my other
                    friend) and he said it was the best site ever! (I would have to agreee!).Then He
                    Passed It On To A group of friends at school, and then, they passed it on, and now
                    the hole school is playing and talking about it!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Michael</strong><br/>
                    Roblox Is The Best Game chosen by a lot of kids and most people choose RPG and stuff
                    but My friends stopped when they saw roblox! you guys rock!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Mateo</strong><br/>
                    Hi, my name is Mateo and im from Argentina. I've been playing Roblox for two months
                    and I really love it. I think is a great game because as im from Argentina my english
                    is bad, and by playing Roblox i've learn a lot of vocabulary. I also think is a
                    great game because it helps children to unleash their creativity and to create everything
                    they want. Thank you very much ROBLOX.
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Isaac</strong><br/>
                    you know, alot of kid stuff on the internet like runescape and nick and stuff like
                    that is ok.... but you guys take it WAY further! YOU GUYS ARE AWESOME! roblox is
                    by far the most fun online game i have EVER played before. so pat yourselves on
                    the back! ROBLOX RULES!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Dragonf900</strong><br/>
                    hi my roblox character Dragonf900 i am 11 years old and 1 of my games a famous i
                    just wanted to say roblox is the best thing ever created its so good and so safe
                    for young kids id rate it 10/10 :D
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>BagleB</strong><br/>
                    I play roblox and I think it is the BEST ONLINE GAME EVER !!!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Jordan</strong><br/>
                    I just wanted to say ROBLOX is not the best but one of the BEST games EVER!!!!!!!!!!
                    :). Out of 10 i would rate it 9.9
                </p>
